; 11 - Line endings
; qaflisp ends a line at LF (Linux, macOS) or CR LF (Windows) - this file
; mixes both, that is fine. An old Mac editor ends lines with CR only:
; VS Code shows a line break there, qaflisp does not. It reads the next
; line as part of this one - as a comment - and its line numbers shift.
;
; Try it:
;   - Line 14 ends with CR only: qaflisp never assembles line 15.
;   - Press Ctrl+S (or use the quick fix): VS Code saves uniform line
;     endings and the warning disappears. git checkout restores the example.

            ORG     $20             ; OK
Start       LDA     #1              ; OK
            INCA                    ; WARNING: this line ends with CR only            INCA                    ; OK: qaflisp reads this line as a comment
            STA     $FB             ; OK: this line and the next end with LF only
            BRA     Start           ; OK
            END
